  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Wheel Tech</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The company&#x2019;s mission and business plan are to raise developing countries from poverty by improving crop yields in a sustainable way. Green Wheel Technology&#x2019;s product is an end to end irrigation solution (solar pump, irrigation system, sensors) for small and medium sized farmers in Africa. Green Wheel Technology (GWT) is enabled to invite local customers to their local pilot farm so that customers can see with their own eyes how the product works, and why this works better than the traditional diesel pump / field-flooding approach. In this way GWT can also validate the business plan locally and get the first LOIs.</narrative>
  </description>
